          "id": "title",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "#2 · the causal distinctions; Bratton's Agentworld brief compared (human-amplified: yes for the ratified comparison)",
          "title": "The image becomes a measure",
          "italic": "The reversal demonstrates the danger of the active idol: the mirror's earlier dependence disappears behind its later efficacy — and the direction in which reciprocal influence is used remains decisive.",
