        {
          "id": "body1",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "The glass now leads a movement: a ranking directs attention; a forecast enters a decision that changes its object; a generated persona offers a manner its user begins to inhabit. The next reflection receives consequences of the mirror's own earlier activity — the exteriorised measure become one of humanity's measures of itself. If the categories acquire exclusive authority, resistance is processed through the image's own",
