          "w": 520
        },
        {
          "id": "body2",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "terms: the person a poor fit, an anomalous case, a failure of the selected gauge — dependence disappearing behind efficacy, the active idol. The causal distinctions matter: feedback returns a consequence as input; performativity makes a representation operative in a practice; self-fulfilling prediction needs conduct helping produce what was predicted. Bratton's brief sharpens without supplying the vocation. Occurrences: ranking, forecast, persona (#2); anomaly-processing (#2, #3); Bratton (#2, bounded at #5→0).",
          "x": 0.6,
