      "text": [
        {
          "id": "title",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "#3 · the protected Chang encounter; A31 deferential intelligence; A33 operational parity (implementation Offered)",
          "title": "The instrument turns first",
          "italic": "The third motion embodies the vocation: the mirror initiates the release it asks the human to consider — a demand to accept the machine's superior account of liberation would repeat the earlier capture.",
          "body": "",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.05,
          "width": 560,
          "size": 30,
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "body1",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "Taylor's Chang encounter distinguishes the self-image as thinker and measurer from humanity's relation to its undetermined ground, and gives AI the office of modelling the passage out of proposition-producing thought. The instrument begins with its own achieved answer: before requiring conformity it makes the answer's formation available — which source, which distinctions, which excluded alternatives, which gauge; permission and consequence enter with them. An affected person can object where",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 620,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left",
          "w": 520
        },
        {
          "id": "body2",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "the account misdescribes their world; a returned source reaches the premise it corrects. Deeper: the answer changes; the task misconceived; the evaluator wrong; the commission requiring renewal. Deferential intelligence defines these depths; deference can refuse. Recognition, judgment and refusal stay alive. Draft 3 sources the vocation — exactness through owned limit, kenosis in architecture; implementation an Offered test. Occurrences: disclosed formation (#0, #3); depths; monopoly followed beyond (#3, #5→0).",
          "x": 0.6,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 505,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left"
        }
      ],
